sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor ATC as ATC Controller
    participant GUI as SchedulingView (GUI)
    participant Svc as ApplicationService
    participant Aging as AgingEngine
    participant Sched as Scheduler / ReadyQueue
    participant Res as ResourceManager (std::mutex)
    participant DB as DatabaseManager
    participant MySQL as MySQL 8 (InnoDB)

    ATC->>GUI: Click "Dispatch Next Process"
    GUI->>Svc: dispatchNextProcess()
    activate Svc

    Svc->>Aging: applyAging(readyQueue)
    activate Aging
    Aging-->>Svc: agingAppliedCount
    deactivate Aging

    Svc->>Sched: scheduleNext()
    activate Sched
    Sched-->>Svc: Candidate Process (e.g., Flight 101, Priority 4)
    deactivate Sched

    Svc->>Res: findCompatibleRunway(Flight 101)
    activate Res
    Res-->>Svc: Runway 1 (RWY-09L) Available
    deactivate Res

    Svc->>Res: ScopedResourceLock lock(m_resourceMutex)
    activate Res
    Note over Res: Critical Section Protected by std::mutex

    Svc->>DB: beginTransaction()
    activate DB
    DB->>MySQL: START TRANSACTION
    MySQL-->>DB: OK

    Svc->>DB: executePessimisticLock(Runway 1)
    DB->>MySQL: SELECT status FROM runways WHERE id=1 FOR UPDATE
    MySQL-->>DB: status = 'FREE'

    Svc->>DB: executeAllocationStatements(Flight 101, Runway 1)
    DB->>MySQL: UPDATE flights SET status='LANDED' WHERE id=101
    DB->>MySQL: INSERT INTO runway_assignments ...
    DB->>MySQL: UPDATE runways SET status='OCCUPIED', current_flight_id=101 WHERE id=1
    DB->>MySQL: UPDATE scheduling_queue SET state='COMPLETED' WHERE flight_id=101
    MySQL-->>DB: All statements OK

    Svc->>DB: commitTransaction()
    DB->>MySQL: COMMIT
    MySQL-->>DB: OK
    deactivate DB

    Svc->>Res: updateMemoryState(Runway 1, OCCUPIED)
    deactivate Res
    Note over Res: Critical Section Exited, Mutex Released

    Svc-->>GUI: Result (Success, Flight Dispatched)
    deactivate Svc
    GUI->>ATC: Display Updated Queue & Runway Status
